+# Patch: Cloud Functions only (drop Serverless Containers for webapp)
+
+## Decision
+Webapp test/prod path on **Yandex Cloud Functions** only.  
+No Serverless Containers / Docker image for runtime.
+
+## Added
+- `webapp-function/index.js` — HTTP CF: static SPA + health + `/api/query` proxy
+- `deploy/test/pack-webapp-fn.sh` — vite build → zip with dist/
+- `deploy/test/deploy-webapp-cf.sh`
+- `deploy/test/api-gateway-test.yaml` + `deploy-apigw.sh`
+- updated smoke/all/env for CF URLs
+
+## Deprecated
+- Docker → Serverless Containers deploy for webapp
+- `build-push.sh` exits with message to use CF
+- `deploy-webapp.sh` redirects to `deploy-webapp-cf.sh`
+- Dockerfile / server.js kept for **local** only
+
+## Keep
+- `ydb-function/` as separate Cloud Function
+- `server.js` for local `npm start`
